<title>POLAND: Prochnik increases loss in Q1. [CORRECTED 18:38 GMT]</title>
<headline>Prochnik increases loss in Q1. [CORRECTED 18:38 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company name in the headline and the text from Mostostal-Export.)</p>
<p>Prochnik preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.06 vs	0.08 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			     0.44 vs	0.27</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.44 vs	0.27</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Prochnik SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 13.77 vs     10.69</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  10.79 vs	8.48</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				  na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.10 vs	0.08</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.60 vs	0.26</p>
<p>    investment				 0.23 vs	0.06</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
